  A[Supercooled Water Droplets in Cloud] -->|Small drops, instant freeze| B[RIME ICE\nOpaque, rough, light, porous]
  A -->|Large drops, spread before freezing| C[GLAZE / CLEAR ICE\nTransparent, hard, heavy, dangerous]
